[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://resources/log_entry.gd" id="1_script"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_script")
log_id = "log_005_corvan_darkness"
title = "Station Log — Cycle 269"
author = "Cmdr. N. Hadid — Commander"
date = "Cycle 269"
content = "Addendum.

Corvan flagged a discrepancy in the long-range imaging data. Fourteen stellar objects from our Cycle 003 baseline are no longer visible. She's requested a diagnostic on the optical array. Alcott has been assigned.

Likely sensor drift. Logging for completeness.

Earth still hasn't acknowledged our Cycle 198 request. Week 8. I've sent a follow-up."
category = "middle"
sort_order = 5
